{"code":2000,"codename":"Koyuki","data":{"id":96,"skin":"","skin_jp":"","skin_cn":"","skin_zh_tw":"","skin_list":[{"id":96,"avatar":"//static.kivo.wiki/images/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/avatar.png","skin":"","skin_cn":""},{"id":50,"avatar":"//static.kivo.wiki/images/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/avatar.png","skin":"泳装","skin_cn":"泳装"}],"family_name":"河和","given_name":"静子","family_name_jp":"河和","given_name_jp":"シズコ","family_name_kr":"카와와","given_name_kr":"시즈코","family_name_en":"Kawawa","given_name_en":"Shizuko","family_name_zh_tw":"河和","given_name_zh_tw":"靜子","family_name_cn":"河和","given_name_cn":"静子","nick_name":"小车,老板娘","momo_talk_signature":"百夜堂好评如潮营业中！","main_relation":46,"relation":[47,45],"age":16,"grade":"二年生","height":153,"birthday":"07-07","hobby":"可爱的接待客人、看板娘拳击","designer":"whoisshe","illustrator":"whoisshe","character_voice":"森永千才","character_voice_cn":"幽若乃","release_date":"2021-02-25","release_date_cn":"2023-08-17","release_date_global":"2021-11-29","school":9,"weapon_type":"SG","is_install":true,"is_install_cn":true,"is_install_global":true,"is_npc":false,"show_list":true,"body_shape":"Small","special_appearance":false,"spine":[31,233,601,973,465],"model":[86,442],"voice":[{"description":"Shizuko_Title","category":"lobby","text":"ブルーアーカイブ","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/IIGAZmt5SvY56DkM4MpIJc1MJ6VhvRin.ogg"},{"description":"Shizuko_Cafe_monolog_1.ogg","category":"cafe","text":"萌え萌えきゅ～ん……これで合ってるかな？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/PGVlXmaGZ8h9JV0umEuTGMfPvB8xvwZM.ogg"},{"description":"Shizuko_Cafe_monolog_2.ogg","category":"cafe","text":"次のお祭りに向けて、しっかりと計画を立てなくちゃ。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/y89SPeKEjCsqd0cp9fudoJ9VrFsdCn58.ogg"},{"description":"Shizuko_Cafe_monolog_3.ogg","category":"cafe","text":"百夜堂の新メニュー、何にしようかな……？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/oV87uVZpvC8B1SNSbmzw6a0XRExHYSeE.ogg"},{"description":"Shizuko_Cafe_monolog_4.ogg","category":"cafe","text":"次のお祭りに、何か新しくて大胆な試みを……全員で着物風バニーガール、とか？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/lsA2WxqD6388INHPGi7wJ1juYNnVmqhW.ogg"},{"description":"Shizuko_Cafe_monolog_5.ogg","category":"cafe","text":"ここ、百夜堂の出張店舗の場所に良さそう！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/oHvYNf7NMUK9hKsi7Rc45G6mra4cAaeo.ogg"},{"description":"Shizuko_CommonSkill.ogg","category":"battle","text":"邪魔はさせません！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/tKygJCwJqJrwdss38DbXfen7ZSoI1yGp.ogg"},{"description":"Shizuko_EventShop_1.ogg","category":"event","text":"お祭りでも、いえ、お祭りだからこそ、百夜堂は止まりませんよ、まあ、私たちは同時にお祭り運営委員会でもあるので。当たり前なんですけどね。えへ。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/F799OyK7gNuDxp7xHMdM9YbueieqJc1s.ogg"},{"description":"Shizuko_EventShop_2.ogg","category":"event","text":"よし、ここは萌え萌えキュン、え？これちょっとふるいですか？そうなんですか？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/tJkX3MC2dcDT6q4VbYM5rxVA54dt9UgD.ogg"},{"description":"Shizuko_EventShop_Buy_1.ogg","category":"event","text":" あっそれ！いえいえ、どうぞどうぞ、別に甘えたら貰おうとか思ていたわけではなく。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/vdnUlVPSzTOw49gwIwRPDqkFeRzj3cpY.ogg"},{"description":"Shizuko_EventShop_Buy_2.ogg","category":"event","text":"それは選ぶとは流石先生、お目が高いです。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/3UQCuwn1kjjR2NvscMcrPduT72rbG9b1.ogg"},{"description":"Shizuko_EventShop_Buy_3.ogg","category":"event","text":"お買い上げありがとうございます！ご主人様。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/mwWQgSXW8w2eXwGgPzNK9n37Xfyu4dhv.ogg"},{"description":"Shizuko_EventShop_Buy_4.ogg","category":"event","text":"あ、それ、やぱりいい品だと思いますよね。えへへ。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/cIeiuZotSTCUVk1lzJAyyKfwRRt0cWbL.ogg"},{"description":"Shizuko_EventShop_End.ogg","category":"event","text":" お祭りは終わってしまいましたが、まだまだ営業中です、残り物には福があるっていますから、さあ先生、どうぞ。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/12X8tNTyqSE9ldcUe5hfmFFTH6mObwE7.ogg"},{"description":"Shizuko_EventShop_Login_1.ogg","category":"event","text":" 百夜堂の出張販売です、さあご主人様、必要なものは何でしょうか？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/eZkqE2SOMbnFfne2xvD6ScX6Y653NHTr.ogg"},{"description":"Shizuko_EventShop_Login_2.ogg","category":"event","text":"あっ、先生、いらしゃいませ、さあさあ、お好きなだけ見ていてください","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/DWOKkw1LFMVc2eDibVyurkV8IZraKVyx.ogg"},{"description":"Shizuko_ExSkill_1.ogg","category":"battle","text":"百夜堂出張販売です！うわあっ！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/CeCaQi9WVkqrLgSHKz3KJGz7pfb1s5ie.ogg"},{"description":"Shizuko_ExSkill_2.ogg","category":"battle","text":"百夜堂はどこへでも出張販売します！わっ、茶器がー！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/oNgdINdO03ttmR4FjxJ3Kpcwu6YcuvAE.ogg"},{"description":"Shizuko_ExSkill_2_b.ogg","category":"battle","text":"百夜堂はどこへでも出張販売します！わっー！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/tLyEqUFsBWGnhO4NRwaCsblrHk2CM7yJ.ogg"},{"description":"Shizuko_ExSkill_3.ogg","category":"battle","text":"ここで活動資金を稼がないと……うわーっ！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/vkTWtfGzaY5bZUlhIPp3yNrTYYGGF75c.ogg"},{"description":"Shizuko_ExSkill_Level_1.ogg","category":"battle","text":"こ、こんなことではめげません！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/nXNAs2x3B2sB4J40aZ7rmJqrImYov3X8.ogg"},{"description":"Shizuko_ExSkill_Level_2.ogg","category":"battle","text":"ちょっ、激しすぎます！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/K0RwdnVkNSz9Y9XimpX1quMg4JVdBqu5.ogg"},{"description":"Shizuko_ExSkill_Level_3.ogg","category":"battle","text":"うぇ、お店の物なのに……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/Hhhylc8YiHHWuDaKgUKNBI2PXoHX0D2y.ogg"},{"description":"Shizuko_ExWeapon_Get.ogg","category":"growup","text":"これ、どんなお祭りでも手に入らない非売品……ですね、えへへ、大切にします！先生。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/yv2hxh08QHgeK10thr1Yfoi0jMrK9W1f.ogg"},{"description":"Shizuko_Formation_In_1.ogg","category":"formation","text":"流石先生、お目が高いですね。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/Sd6lyT69HqJtaTqPq9xXdv08akvD4kCy.ogg"},{"description":"Shizuko_Formation_In_2.ogg","category":"formation","text":"よし、お祭りの予算稼ぐチャンス、じゃなくて、っが、頑張ります。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/ETndplDeVUwJT5LDR6xJ3y2zSTf1L3vy.ogg"},{"description":"Shizuko_Gachaget.ogg","category":"growup","text":"えへへ、お祭り運営委員会のシズコです～。 これからよろしくお願いしますね、先生？え？ ……ああ、はいはいそうですよ、営業用の台詞です！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/olFL2FiUBsjR60QDSBKxAJO462sJd1zN.ogg"},{"description":"Shizuko_Growup_1.ogg","category":"growup","text":"えへへ、シズコは～先生がシズコのこと大切にしてくれてと～っても嬉しいです～。にゃんにゃん！……うん、私可愛い！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/uXpjYfnSZMpTjkzm0E2igXisJTNSoRpb.ogg"},{"description":"Shizuko_Growup_2.ogg","category":"growup","text":"わ～い、成長しました～！ブイ！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/lt2or4al90FUvSOKJE8tLsQE1YEVnEs3.ogg"},{"description":"Shizuko_Growup_3.ogg","category":"growup","text":"ま、まあ？期待に応えられるようには頑張りますけど……？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/IwSaqx6yPpyxGlNQ1ErIaTrz657LzjYY.ogg"},{"description":"Shizuko_Growup_4.ogg","category":"growup","text":"\t 先生にこんなに良くしてもらって……シズコ、改めて頑張ります！百夜堂の店主兼看板娘として！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/f1DloXRFebOe9vr8z3vf1xV7KI6n6PdI.ogg"},{"description":"Shizuko_Lobby_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":" 先生にこんなに良くしてもらって……シズコ、改めて頑張ります！百夜堂の店主兼看板娘として！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/0m99c5OxZaBNFxj3xC8YM8hR61vAuF7S.ogg"},{"description":"Shizuko_Lobby_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"最近そばにいるだけで、知らず知らずのうちに気が緩んでしまうんですよね～。 ……先生のせいですよ？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/iPBEP1fY6nIYLndmrXMEKjOxBe9dMgV8.ogg"},{"description":"Shizuko_Lobby_3.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"あ、帰ったらまだ百夜堂の仕事があるんでした。 ……大変だね、ですか？ いえいえ、大したことでは無いですよ〜。これも私がやるべきことですから。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/G3CovB7C9Sv7ddHt38aMcqlcka2lSpKx.ogg"},{"description":"Shizuko_Lobby_4.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"え？可愛い、ですか？ はあ、揶揄わないでください、先生は私の素顔を知ってるじゃないですか…… ……それが可愛い？う、ぐっ……。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/BgG5I4LbdbNMxB89j9Lzmeb5jHePrrmY.ogg"},{"description":"Shizuko_Lobby_5.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"先生財布の紐は固い方ですか？気を付けた方が良いですよ、 百鬼夜行のお祭りと百夜堂のあんみつは、それをこじ開けてしまうほど魅力的ですからね？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/E1eHM3Petqz0Tcw0fnWU3I2VSV4A3hAm.ogg"},{"description":"Shizuko_LogIn_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":" あっ、おかえりなさい先生！にゃんにゃん！ ……うん、今のは完璧。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/GN7qAZyzPsSOY0HepWsDZQ7mGvO9ebgQ.ogg"},{"description":"Shizuko_LogIn_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"うう……疲れた…。 あっ、先生、おかえりなさい！さあさあこちらへ、遠慮なさらず～！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/sbY9Lu1Ve3JDIX1E1OLoq19dP2K0wfB3.ogg"},{"description":"Shizuko_MemorialLobby_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"ふふっ、お帰りなさいませ～ご主人様～？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/18rs7nbImp62JxOxXhruA425WWIdQGAC.ogg"},{"description":"Shizuko_MemorialLobby_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"そうですよぉ～。見ての通り、現在進行形でおサボり中で～す。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/qksNoQzAIkPTlyTeuqn5LFEJNYVyIqen.ogg"},{"description":"Shizuko_MemorialLobby_3_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"……不思議ですね。こういうことはしちゃいけないって、気を張ってなきゃって、ずっと思ってたはずなんですが……。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/Kd6CrHth3UZ5dbJqEKFuDedYomLa9wPz.ogg"},{"description":"Shizuko_MemorialLobby_3_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"先生と一緒にいると……。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/2D0oAwsOWVAfKG9ClDrNOLJiYb424Bu0.ogg"},{"description":"Shizuko_MemorialLobby_3_3.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"なんだか、気が抜けちゃうって言うか……。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/Sv1PCLr9MAs2XKMwjGjOU8iUFtTLxiVv.ogg"},{"description":"Shizuko_MemorialLobby_4_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"ほら、先生？こっちに来てください。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/nQgmlSQtMO9cUfQksUG1H4ah5FrxwDls.ogg"},{"description":"Shizuko_MemorialLobby_4_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"……私をこんな風にした責任、取ってくれますよね？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/ADWVC0pQccvk44f6xZgNfGzYTx0kbMir.ogg"},{"description":"Shizuko_Relationship_Up_1.ogg","category":"growup","text":"（ち、近い！せ、先生との距離がこんな！大丈夫かな！大丈夫なのかな！！）","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/ptHWd1lQGMHO1sV3SDG3p3Q0w1jGZwLW.ogg"},{"description":"Shizuko_Relationship_Up_2.ogg","category":"growup","text":"この甘い気持ち、百夜堂のあんみつを口いっぱいに頬張った時みたいな……。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/7avy1EoZkL5B4dJ70269ETGfupyU3UjO.ogg"},{"description":"Shizuko_Relationship_Up_3.ogg","category":"growup","text":"先生と一緒にいると、いつも……まるでお祭りの日みたいな気分になります。本当に不思議ですね。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/jCewZrKBStEIpL0GIjKSmPxbJ07XfvDo.ogg"},{"description":"Shizuko_Relationship_Up_4.ogg","category":"growup","text":"楽しいお祭りもいつかは終わるもの、と言いますね……。でもせめて、本当にその時が来るまで……もう少し、そばにいても……いいですか？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/2GOUtdrinGt2Qp7EaZfKB9ydjYWq7pyf.ogg"},{"description":"Shizuko_Season_Birthday.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"えっ、わ、私の誕生日を祝ってくださるんですか？ ……っ！あ、み、見ないでください！今、多分見せられない顔になってますから……！ ……っ、えへっ、えへへっ……！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/YiWidDAbQBbbvMHwHxG4p7Ql3qXqUroz.ogg"},{"description":"Shizuko_Season_Birthday_Player.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"えっ、わ、私の誕生日を祝ってくださるんですか？ ……っ！あ、み、見ないでください！今、多分見せられない顔になってますから……！ ……っ、えへっ、えへへっ……！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/AVQ5RrCvfW3YQTzLvACvJPiPLGyjf9Vg.ogg"},{"description":"Shizuko_Season_Halloween.ogg","category":"lobby","text":" トリックオアトリート！さあ先生、やって来た生徒には、百夜堂のあんみつを押し売りしてやりましょう！ え、ダメなんですか？どうして！？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/K6hMWxmk2x80uPyxzeyPjGfKBComSvCs.ogg"},{"description":"Shizuko_Season_NewYear.ogg","category":"lobby","text":" ハッピーニューイヤー！お正月ですし、こたつの中でぬくぬくするとしましょう～ ちょっ、あ、あと5分だけ……！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/q9d2OUbooeckGmNaRLXrSl3rV9JCZEQx.ogg"},{"description":"Shizuko_Season_Xmas.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"今日はクリスマス！お祭りの日です！私たちお祭り運営委員会はもちろん見逃しませんよ！さあいきましょう、先生！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/3c34jDiCdgbdoHXmxs85cj28nLBZHxEK.ogg"}],"voice_cn":[{"description":"shizuko_title.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"蔚蓝档案！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/5YGb2pzC1GSj4TeQZ8Ni5ArAVAlQCmRU.ogg"},{"description":"shizuko_cafe_monolog_1.ogg","category":"cafe","text":"萌萌比心～……我……做得对不对呀？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/9sUkYOTENKXGZVxTQwcGafPlXzo5xqUH.ogg"},{"description":"shizuko_cafe_monolog_2.ogg","category":"cafe","text":"要给下次的庆典制定一个详细的计划啦。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/lawDqUI7RCcjsF24E0dHTZrvvpA5msMp.ogg"},{"description":"shizuko_cafe_monolog_3.ogg","category":"cafe","text":"百夜堂的新菜单，该怎么安排呢……？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/AjrXa5NP7RtelQglpi603HhCjCjAqm6p.ogg"},{"description":"shizuko_cafe_monolog_4.ogg","category":"cafe","text":"下次的庆典,我想大胆一点,搞点不一样的,比如让所有人穿上兔……嘿嘿……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/zcocwDtRfN1BnMtHrMtLGRxMV6iLz7VW.ogg"},{"description":"shizuko_cafe_monolog_5.ogg","category":"cafe","text":"把这里当成百夜堂的临时店铺好像不错！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/5iGWoKKweTgHxFY5akGIo7sDkN5E6o9C.ogg"},{"description":"shizuko_commonskill.ogg","category":"battle","text":"不许碍事！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/OhF5cxq8lE79vbt4msNv7Q3wWNClrehq.ogg"},{"description":"shizuko_eventshop_1.ogg","category":"event","text":"就算是庆典……不对，正因为是庆典，百夜堂才不会休息！ ……呃，不过因为我们也是庆典运营管理部，不休息也是理所当然的，诶嘿。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/cnVMNZ6uP5CBFuKXmwTr8eUVk8AZzOFI.ogg"},{"description":"shizuko_eventshop_2.ogg","category":"event","text":"好，这里应该……萌——萌——比心♪ ……诶，这个已经过时了吗？真的假的？！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/NVmE9G3na4L80z8xYgl81GQfhNG03ECm.ogg"},{"description":"shizuko_eventshop_buy_1.ogg","category":"event","text":"啊，那个……！没，没事没事，您请您请。绝对不是因为我想把卖剩下的给……吞了……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/VcycJw6GRGQTXkiqitPzsJa84U5zydoX.ogg"},{"description":"shizuko_eventshop_buy_2.ogg","category":"event","text":"真是会选，不愧是老师！眼光独到！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/Bj3MrkkW48gD1msoXnozxMgIrM0ZMSJ3.ogg"},{"description":"shizuko_eventshop_buy_3.ogg","category":"event","text":"感谢您的购买，主人♪","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/c29rNq4H3G08LwoZw2DPx50rcv9w5y5I.ogg"},{"description":"shizuko_eventshop_buy_4.ogg","category":"event","text":"啊，您也觉得这是好东西对吧？诶嘿嘿。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/qauPMFa5SZFOAy4jLCwF7vu89x3MMZM8.ogg"},{"description":"shizuko_eventshop_end.ogg","category":"event","text":"虽然庆典结束了，但我们仍然在营业。 据说大家分享之后剩下的部分叫做“福根儿”，老师可别错过呀！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/jl6ibRCPEZBwHnPe6Ad7X0oxBVRdjNtf.ogg"},{"description":"shizuko_eventshop_login_1.ogg","category":"event","text":"百夜堂出摊啦！来来来，主人，需要什么呢？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/oqCddhnCrCttmIV0GBWR49t1pWaRftW2.ogg"},{"description":"shizuko_eventshop_login_2.ogg","category":"event","text":"啊，老师！欢迎光临~！ 来来来，您随便看随便挑！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/u5JMQQSF3l9re8A9zxgcPttONeU8oQ3h.ogg"},{"description":"shizuko_exskill_1.ogg","category":"battle","text":"百夜堂出摊啦！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/NNG7qxHNcSvkVZ43nTWNUvTHxTcwC5Sd.ogg"},{"description":"shizuko_exskill_2.ogg","category":"battle","text":"无论在哪里，百夜堂都可以出摊，诶！？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/9uVQKF5LyrjZBE4WejIrt4O8WJv9EvRO.ogg"},{"description":"shizuko_exskill_3.ogg","category":"battle","text":"一定要在这里赚得活动经费！诶？！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/jBDICnjkP32A3An0qJBQz8OGz8NaalRb.ogg"},{"description":"shizuko_exskill_level_1.ogg","category":"battle","text":"我……我才不会就这样放弃呢！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/yJ2ciVwTz0P8wxjNz5CNrqlnJm8Sueoa.ogg"},{"description":"shizuko_exskill_level_2.ogg","category":"battle","text":"太，太激烈了吧！？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/hc9QPIr1kGZKuvfQ0jUeA7hLapcfW1yL.ogg"},{"description":"shizuko_exskill_level_3.ogg","category":"battle","text":"诶，这可都是店里的东西啊。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/tQVw1JzuQTNtIR6HwsnVTiHw31Br84IX.ogg"},{"description":"shizuko_exweapon_get.ogg","category":"growup","text":"这可是任何庆典上都买不到的非卖品呀。诶嘿嘿，我会好好珍惜的！老师！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/Ps6giJaA4TP4wUp3OqBbyYvkre6EpgIO.ogg"},{"description":"shizuko_formation_in_1.ogg","category":"formation","text":"不愧是老师，很有眼光嘛。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/pOr4vDap9wvyhfUUFJrlYDSkhPaSZjVf.ogg"},{"description":"shizuko_formation_in_2.ogg","category":"formation","text":"好耶，有机会提高庆典的预算……呃没有没有，我会加油的！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/EIMXRq6FtesLzSN8GwkhLI2fYiNXGSWp.ogg"},{"description":"shizuko_gachaget.ogg","category":"growup","text":"哎嘿嘿，我是庆典运营管理部的静子～以后请多多关照啊，老师。诶？啊……对对对……这是营业用的台词……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/QdIOMqE3YEPLtywfHtoALiaU9E8VqI5v.ogg"},{"description":"shizuko_growup_1.ogg","category":"growup","text":"嘿嘿嘿，老师对静子这么照顾，静子真的超级开心！喵喵~我真可爱。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/DejpLu6pQ4cUekjiVuRLHzf93Lz1ebRb.ogg"},{"description":"shizuko_growup_2.ogg","category":"growup","text":"唔哦！我成长了！V~","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/oBLDAfzXCWrm1ey6YywSrhovTlxE4AVf.ogg"},{"description":"shizuko_growup_3.ogg","category":"growup","text":"行，行啊，既然你这么期待，那我就努力一下下了……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/kaMHRBbSieDMoFe23i3hA5mcIbpNgvwK.ogg"},{"description":"shizuko_growup_4.ogg","category":"growup","text":"老师对静子这么好，静子一定会加倍努力的！毕竟，静子可是百夜堂的店长，兼招牌女郎啊！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/RtLurJPyNvXc4GNXYvyLqezA4JlTZASd.ogg"},{"description":"shizuko_lobby_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"您叫我了吗？今天需要我帮您做什么呢？不管是什么，尽管交给我吧～！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/c9GxzxpdFCtMD4xnrBZa4o39UNi2YFKr.ogg"},{"description":"shizuko_lobby_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"最近跟老师在一起而已，可经常不知不觉就松懈下来了~唔……这都要怪老师哦？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/wN7uySMiOkgDync0SjPhSlsNs6IS49sF.ogg"},{"description":"shizuko_lobby_3.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"啊，回去还有百夜堂的工作要做呢。 ……您问我是不是很累？ 不累不累，没什么大不了的啦～这都是我应该做的。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/5menuDGpzLuGyvTWRsiGU31jvoVq91Jf.ogg"},{"description":"shizuko_lobby_4.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"诶？您说我很可爱？ 唉，请您别损我啦！老师又不是不知道我本来什么样子…… ……那样才最可爱？呃，呜……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/xWz7NUX1ScqWZ2yzYxTOA6MqMIZGYuVt.ogg"},{"description":"shizuko_lobby_5.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"老师，有看好自己的钱包吗？要时刻小心哦！ 因为百鬼夜行的庆典和百夜堂的馅蜜可是魅力十足，足以把紧闭的钱包撬开哦。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/D8gDA8ndXmm4eNTEGv3cVXyZrTa5k5lf.ogg"},{"description":"shizuko_login_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"啊，欢迎回来，老师！喵喵！ ……嗯，刚才的很完美。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/XvrYcPJGlc29US2zaUCk5ovPXI3NYVjh.ogg"},{"description":"shizuko_login_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"呃……累死…… 啊，老师，您回来了！快来快来，这边请，不用客气～！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/1uHOZffSkhZpr684Oi5gLNcQpym3T8LL.ogg"},{"description":"shizuko_memoriallobby_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"诶嘿嘿，欢迎您回来~主人~？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/oGG92s6YulOx321LHY9A07gtFfk4kyQ6.ogg"},{"description":"shizuko_memoriallobby_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"对的呀~您没看错，我现在摸鱼摸得正开心呢~","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/FWc2UuWKvFalcvJNvMN9uSWtDjCeNWcj.ogg"},{"description":"shizuko_memoriallobby_3_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"……真不可思议啊。明明知道自己不能偷懒，明明知道要打起精神来……明明一直都是这么想的来着……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/GwlHsg8CqMokPCmogsjYBqvkHh6EX5N5.ogg"},{"description":"shizuko_memoriallobby_3_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"但是只要和老师在一起……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/GcEgixV9sWjm8IBTCN0Mrit88TrTQCmk.ogg"},{"description":"shizuko_memoriallobby_3_3.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"总感觉一点干劲都没有了……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/nDHhJZl6qnkzHGGS0HeLAVbUwGdNpzXP.ogg"},{"description":"shizuko_memoriallobby_4_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"来呀，老师？请您到这边来。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/amTdj2wjjSzFxSuADijpPTthrCVSXIWH.ogg"},{"description":"shizuko_memoriallobby_4_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"……是您让我变成这个样子的，您会负责的吧？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/FN9zcMY21toU0NHgUzxpmfFQmx8nJUXK.ogg"},{"description":"shizuko_relationship_up_1.ogg","category":"growup","text":"好好好，好近！和老师距离也太——可以吗？真的可以吗？！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/jpoQtjpxkiErtt3V1YJV3Pwm7xzb5prG.ogg"},{"description":"shizuko_relationship_up_2.ogg","category":"growup","text":"这种甜蜜的感觉，简直就像我嘴里面填满了百夜堂的馅蜜一样！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/SD2qNZyG8QJOQomfCi5XZFiWkkgpJggp.ogg"},{"description":"shizuko_relationship_up_3.ogg","category":"growup","text":"每次我和老师在一起，感觉就像在过节一样的，真的很奇怪诶……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/2n6mVP9yHWJAGZ1DUbOFMleMYFBZI7ix.ogg"},{"description":"shizuko_relationship_up_4.ogg","category":"growup","text":"有句话说，天下没有不散的宴席，但是至少，在宴席散去之前，能在我身边，多待一会儿吗……？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/5lUORlZpwmw9JgMUQxcaOmKoSXTjR5CF.ogg"},{"description":"shizuko_season_birthday.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"诶，您，您祝我生日快乐？ ……呃！啊，请，请别看我！我的表情现在肯定没法见人……！ ……嘿，嘿嘿嘿，嘿嘿嘿……！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/3GUgyAqsyiAGZVRYktQfXXpbVhRCPFsB.ogg"},{"description":"shizuko_season_birthday_player.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"老师，祝您生日快乐！ 来，我们去百夜堂吧。我会用庆典运营管理部部长的权力，开一场像庆典一样的生日宴会！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/1x4T9nkqInYZ6vYGiOytk6syM2hGaMQs.ogg"},{"description":"shizuko_season_halloween.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"不给糖，就捣蛋！ 老师老师，如果有人过来， 就强迫他来买百夜堂的馅蜜吧！ 诶？不行吗？为什么？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/jslnEW4d4h7jnzu8RZszSeTD4GWeCnE7.ogg"},{"description":"shizuko_season_newyear.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"新年快乐！ 既然是新年， 就在被炉里暖暖和和地待着吧～ 等……啊！再让我待5分钟就行……！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/cgROIIPt7IY1Jx7lDZIrdL5wQVpcozvE.ogg"},{"description":"shizuko_season_xmas.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"今天是圣诞节！ 是举办庆典的日子！我们庆典运营管理部肯定不能缺席啊！好了老师，快走吧！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/r3vD3jqv2fr76ZQYD9ltUjWmn7YYJ2jr.ogg"},{"description":"shizuko_season_midautumn","category":"lobby","text":"百夜堂今日限定独家配方月饼！老师您快尝尝吧，吃完之后，记得代表沙勒找我们订购月饼礼盒哦~","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/TKpU6uOMlojXYAkbxcjkIlwgiW9HwxSr.ogg"},{"description":"shizuko_title","category":"lobby","text":"Blue Archive!","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/ozctVqF67bJjaf59Zw7Ywg1ArJoqq5eA.ogg"},{"description":"shizuko_season_chinesenewyear","category":"lobby","text":"老师，新春快乐！……才不是营业状态，刚刚的新春祝福是认真的！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/IoKjpBeNUY1B3UFPfsXxdKOHaXFEqyT2.ogg"},{"description":"shizuko_cafe_monolog_4","category":"cafe","text":"下次的庆典，我想大胆一点，搞点不一样的……比如让所有人穿上和风兔女郎……嘿嘿……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/Nmk25EncEIUaiObuC018S0TztYWlmIVd.ogg"},{"description":"shizuko_exskill_2","category":"battle","text":"无论顾客在哪，百夜堂都能为您服务！呃啊我的茶器！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/k05NWM39hEVeXApACCkk7jtqSaef0gjO.ogg"},{"description":"shizuko_formation_in_2","category":"formation","text":"好耶，这是提高庆典预算的好机会……呃不对，我会加油的！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/oJQnIzk46HjgnlRObeuYC25CMkUdh3DK.ogg"},{"description":"shizuko_growup_4","category":"growup","text":"老师对静子这么好，静子一定会加倍努力的！毕竟，静子可是百夜堂的店长，兼看板娘啊！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/IbhR74r6INTukKdScmhsRjh1KNZWbU1m.ogg"},{"description":"shizuko_lobby_2","category":"lobby","text":"最近只是待在老师身边而已，可经常不知不觉就松懈下来了～ 唔……这都要怪老师哦？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/JWtdYxeofFBOZ2SY9bz0kCXxJ5Juqj9d.ogg"}],"voice_kr":[{"description":"Shizuko_Title","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/original/Shizuko_Title.ogg"},{"description":"shizuko_cafe_monolog_1","category":"cafe","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E5%AD%90/original/shizuko_cafe_monolog_1.ogg"},{"description":"shizuko_cafe_monolog_2","category":"cafe","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B2%B3%E5%92%8C%20%E9%9D%99%E